---

### Engineering Governance & Compliance Summary

* **Layer Mapping & Naming**: Preserves exact stable component IDs (`COG-*`, `GOV-*`, `CMP-*`) while mapping file paths cleanly to `components/ax/`, `components/ag/`, and `components/ac/` respectively[cite: 18].
* **Deferred & Research Components**: Components such as `COG-CMP-004` (Swarm Coordinator) and `GOV-FED-001` (Federation Gateway) retain their metadata and contract definitions in the catalog while production runtime execution remains gated or deferred[cite: 18].
* **Build & CI Behavior**: Changes are validated through affected-work routing. Contract changes, state migrations, and authority modifications trigger comprehensive cross-layer integration suites and mandatory peer/security reviews[cite: 18].
